      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "Keys may exist in four states with respect to a given TXT record: - Absent (key does not appear at all) - Present with no value (“key” appears alone) - Present with empty value (“key=” appears in TXT record) - Present with non-empty value (“key=value” appears in TXT record) For more details refer to “Data Syntax for DNS-SD TXT Records” in [`dns-sd.org`](https://developer.apple.comhttp://files.dns-sd.org/draft-cheshire-dnsext-dns-sd.txt)",
